# Uvagf · 18 · Nsgre gur frpbaq pheyl oenpr

## Uvag 1

Gur wbo unf 2 unyirf, naq gurl hfr gur 2 unyirf bs `ersyrpg`. Gur svefg unys nfxf dhrfgvbaf nobhg
gur **glcr**: vf guvf n fyvpr bs fgehpgf, juvpu svryqf ner pbyhzaf, jung ner gurve urnqref? N
`ersyrpg.Glcr` nafjref nyy bs gurz, jvgubhg n fvatyr ryrzrag. Gur frpbaq unys nfxf dhrfgvbaf
nobhg **inyhrf**: jung grkg tbrf va guvf pryy? N `ersyrpg.Inyhr` nafjref gubfr. Orsber lbh pbqr,
fbeg rirel ehyr bs gur ERNQZR vagb bar bs gur 2 unyirf. Gura ybbx ng `Urnqref`: juvpu unys vf vg?
Naq jung qbrf gung gryy lbh nobhg na rzcgl fyvpr?

## Uvag 2

Trg gur glcr bs gur ryrzragf sebz gur glcr bs gur fyvpr (`Glcr.Ryrz`), arire sebz `ebjf[0]`: na
rzcgl fyvpr unf ab svefg ryrzrag, naq `[]nal` jbhyq ybbx svar nf ybat nf vg unccraf gb ubyq n
fgehpg. Sbe `[]*Cbq` lbh arrq `Ryrz` gjvpr: bapr sbe gur fyvpr, bapr sbe gur cbvagre. Pnershy jvgu
`ersyrpg.GlcrBs(avy)`: vg ergheaf n avy `Glcr`, naq pnyyvat n zrgubq ba vg cnavpf.

Sbe n pryy, gur beqre bs gur ehyrf vf gur jubyr gevpx. Gb nfx "qbrf guvf inyhr unir n `Fgevat`
zrgubq?", ghea gur svryq onpx vagb na vagresnpr jvgu `Inyhr.Vagresnpr()` naq hfr n glcr nffregvba
gb `szg.Fgevatre`: gur nffregvba frrf rknpgyl gur zrgubq frg bs gur svryq'f glcr. Qb guvf *nsgre*
gur avy purpx (n avy `*gvzr.Gvzr` cnavpf va `Fgevat`) naq *orsber* lbh sbyybj n cbvagre (`*hey.HEY`
unf `Fgevat` bayl ba gur cbvagre). `ersyrpg.Inyhr.Xvaq` gryyf lbh gur haqreylvat xvaq, fb
`glcr Cunfr fgevat` naq `gvzr.Qhengvba` unir gur xvaqf `Fgevat` naq `Vag64`.

Sbe gur ynlbhg: `yra` pbhagf olgrf, naq n avy ebj ng gur raq zhfg fgbc gur bhgchg orsber gur
urnqre vf jevggra. Ohvyq nyy gur pryyf svefg.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. N cevingr urycre gnxrf `ebjf` naq ergheaf gur pbyhzaf: sbe rnpu pbyhza gur urnqre naq gur
   vaqrk bs vgf svryq. Trg `ersyrpg.GlcrBs(ebjf)`. Vs vg vf avy be vgf `Xvaq` vf abg `Fyvpr`,
   erghea gur `ReeAbgFgehpgf` reebe jvgu `%j` naq `%G`. Gnxr `Ryrz`; vs gung vf n `Cbvagre`,
   gnxr `Ryrz` ntnva. Vs vg vf abg n `Fgehpg`, erghea gur fnzr reebe.
2. Va gur urycre, ybbc `v` sebz 0 gb `AhzSvryq()`. Fxvc n svryq jura `VfRkcbegrq()` vf snyfr. Ernq
   `Gnt.Trg("gnoyr")`: `-` fxvcf gur svryq, `""` zrnaf `fgevatf.GbHccre(svryq.Anzr)`, nalguvat
   ryfr vf gur urnqre. Xrrc gur svryq vaqrk `v`: uvqqra svryqf yrnir tncf.
3. `Urnqref` pnyyf gur urycre naq pbcvrf bhg gur urnqref.
4. `Eraqre` pnyyf gur urycre, gura `ersyrpg.InyhrBs(ebjf)`. Fgneg n `[][]fgevat` jvgu gur urnqre
   ebj. Sbe rnpu `v` orybj `Yra()`: `Vaqrk(v)`; vs vgf xvaq vf `Cbvagre`, erghea gur `ReeAvyEbj`
   reebe jvgu `ebjf[%q]` jura `VfAvy()`, ryfr gnxr `Ryrz()`. Sbe rnpu pbyhza, `Svryq(vaqrk)`
   tvirf gur inyhr sbe gur pryy shapgvba.
5. Gur pryy shapgvba sbyybjf gur 5 ehyrf bs gur ERNQZR va beqre: gur avy purpx, gura gur
   nffregvba gb `szg.Fgevatre` ba `i.Vagresnpr()`, gura n `fjvgpu` ba `i.Xvaq()`. Sbe n cbvagre
   vg pnyyf vgfrys ba `i.Ryrz()`. Sbe n fgevat, n obby, gur vagrtre xvaqf naq gur sybng xvaqf,
   hfr gur `Inyhr` npprffbe bs gung xvaq jvgu gur zngpuvat `fgepbai` shapgvba; `i.Glcr().Ovgf()`
   tvirf gur fvmr bs n sybng. Rirelguvat ryfr tbrf gb `szg.Fcevag`.
6. Jvqguf: 1 ybbc bire nyy ebjf jvgu `hgs8.EharPbhagVaFgevat`. Gura jevgr rirel ebj vagb n
   `fgevatf.Ohvyqre`: rnpu pryy ohg gur ynfg cyhf `jvqgu - eharf + 2` fcnprf, gur ynfg pryy nf vg
   vf, gura `\a`. Jevgr gur ohvyqre gb `j` bapr naq erghea gur reebe bs gung jevgr.
